<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωγάλιοι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστράγαλοι ἢ πόρνοι</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>; cf. sq. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωγάς</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωγάνιον</span></b> , τό, <i>dewlap of oxen</i>, Ambraciote and
			Epirote word, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.
			</span></i> Utic. ap. Sch. l.c.—In <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογάνιον</span></b>  sine expl., in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωγάλιον. λωγάς:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόρνη</span>, Id.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωγάλιοι</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λώγασος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταυρεία μάστιξ</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωγάω</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theognost.
				<u>Can.</u>
				149
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλώγη:</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλεγεν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλωγὴ: ἔλεγον</span> cod.), 
				Dor.
			
				contr.
			from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλώγαε</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λώγη:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλάμη, καὶ συναγωγὴ σίτου</span>,
		Id.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
